's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"f779513a70416025358356f4fde3b0d0","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"571447dfe9794011d6b73607d4ab1dcd","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"0edde3dc8a61e09c0b4fd6e7f3b7714f","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"87f0d89adf435d8393455aee3e48a114","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"d6a8f0457078436bdd2104d5e1e61d88","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"9be54207750dd3b3c77aae7eb3c1ca79","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"91c76e6158c3834fbda6d6dd873740a2","originalFileName":"a4d51fd1-2e0c-47ea-b938-a5d492c4f692-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"log","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":68},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"ccf55238